&lt;div class="msgHead"&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;
&lt;span class="subject"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=subject:%22Re%5C%3A+%5C%5Bblink%5C-dev%5C%5D+Intent+to+Ship%5C%3A+CSS+flow%5C-start+and+flow%5C-end+alignment+keywords%22&amp;o=newest" rel="nofollow"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="name"&gt;Re: [blink-dev] Intent to Ship: CSS flow-start and flow-end alignment keywords&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class="darkgray font13"&gt;
&lt;span class="sender pipe"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=from:%22Chris+Harrelson%22" rel="nofollow"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Person"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="name"&gt;Chris Harrelson&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="date"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=date:20261021" rel="nofollow"&gt;Wed, 21 Oct 2026 09:34:06 -0700&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div itemprop="articleBody" class="msgBody"&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;I'd like to wait for the spec PR to land; it's currently under review.

On Mon, Oct 19, 2026 at 11:28 AM 'Dan Clark' via blink-dev &lt;
&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="95f7f9fcfbfeb8f1f0e3d5f6fde7faf8fce0f8bbfae7f2"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt; wrote:&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

&gt; Can you please request the other reviews (or request N/A) in Chromestatus
&gt; (Enterprise, Testing, Adoption)?
&gt;
&gt; On Monday, October 19, 2026 at 11:26:36 AM UTC-7 &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="5427383d333c7a7a7a14373c263b393d21397a3b2633"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;
&gt; wrote:
&gt;
&gt;&gt; LGTM1
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; On Thursday, October 15, 2026 at 11:22:04 AM UTC-7 Celeste Pan wrote:
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt; Thank you for the review! And yes, the relevant tests in
&gt;&gt;&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://wpt.fyi/results/css/css-align"&gt;https://wpt.fyi/results/css/css-align&lt;/a&gt; are all passing (the tests which
&gt;&gt;&gt; formerly used `flex-start/end`).
&gt;&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt; Best,
&gt;&gt;&gt; Celeste
&gt;&gt;&gt; ------------------------------
&gt;&gt;&gt; *From:* Philip Jägenstedt &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="3e5851511010107e5d564c5153574b5310514c59"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt; *Sent:* Thursday, October 15, 2026 2:10 AM
&gt;&gt;&gt; *To:* Celeste Pan &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="7b181e171e085555553b161218091408141d0f55181416"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt; *Cc:* &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="1a787673743434345a7972687577736f773475687d"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt; &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="85e7e9ecebabababc5e6edf7eae8ecf0e8abeaf7e2"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt;; Alison Maher &lt;
