&gt;&gt;&gt; Link to entry on the Chrome Platform Status
&gt;&gt;&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5069051687731200?gate=5575518593351680"&gt;https://chromestatus.com/feature/5069051687731200?gate=5575518593351680&lt;/a&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt; Links to previous Intent discussions
&gt;&gt;&gt; Intent to Prototype:
