&lt;div class="msgHead"&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;
&lt;span class="subject"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=subject:%22%5C%5Bblink%5C-dev%5C%5D+Intent+to+Prototype%5C%3A+Web+Smart+Card+API%5C%3A+Allow+developers+to+release+a+SmartCardContext+explicitly%22&amp;o=newest" rel="nofollow"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="name"&gt;[blink-dev] Intent to Prototype: Web Smart Card API: Allow developers to release a SmartCardContext explicitly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class="darkgray font13"&gt;
&lt;span class="sender pipe"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=from:%22Chromestatus%22" rel="nofollow"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Person"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="name"&gt;Chromestatus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="date"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=date:20261023" rel="nofollow"&gt;Fri, 23 Oct 2026 01:49:21 -0700&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div itemprop="articleBody" class="msgBody"&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;Contact emails
&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="e59f8297cbcbcba5868d978a888c9088cb8a9782"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

Explainer
&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/WICG/web-smart-card/pull/62"&gt;https://github.com/WICG/web-smart-card/pull/62&lt;/a&gt;


Specification
&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://wicg.github.io/web-smart-card"&gt;https://wicg.github.io/web-smart-card&lt;/a&gt;


Summary
Now `SmartCardContext`s can be explicitly released, releasing also the 
underlying PC/SC resource. Without this, developers had to either use a small 
number of static contexts across the lifetime of their application or depend on 
garbage collection.


Blink component
Blink&gt;SmartCard


Web Feature ID
Missing feature


Motivation
Without this, developers have to either use a small number of static contexts 
across the lifetime of their application or depend on garbage collection. The 
current state also violates TAG guideline &quot;Don't expose garbage collection&quot;, as 
the success of establishing a new context depends on whether the garbage 
collection ran or not.


Initial public proposal
&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/WICG/web-smart-card/issues/60"&gt;https://github.com/WICG/web-smart-card/issues/60&lt;/a&gt;


Goals for experimentation
None


Requires code in //chrome?
False


Tracking bug
&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://crbug.com/573866986"&gt;https://crbug.com/573866986&lt;/a&gt;


Estimated milestones

No milestones specified



