&lt;div class="msgHead"&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;
&lt;span class="subject"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=subject:%22%5C%5Bblink%5C-dev%5C%5D+Intent+to+Implement+and+Ship%5C%3A+AccentColor%5C%2FText+follows+accent%5C-color%22&amp;o=newest" rel="nofollow"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="name"&gt;[blink-dev] Intent to Implement and Ship: AccentColor/Text follows accent-color&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class="darkgray font13"&gt;
&lt;span class="sender pipe"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=from:%22%27Alexander+Kyereboah%27+via+blink%5C-dev%22" rel="nofollow"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Person"&gt;&lt;span itemprop="name"&gt;'Alexander Kyereboah' via blink-dev&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="date"&gt;&lt;a href="/search?l=blink-dev@chromium.org&amp;q=date:20261023" rel="nofollow"&gt;Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:12:20 -0700&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div itemprop="articleBody" class="msgBody"&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;*Contact emails*
&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="c7a6acbea2b5a2a5e9e9e987aaaea4b5a8b4a8a1b3e9a4a8aa"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;

*Specification*
&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-4/#css-system-colors"&gt;https://www.w3.org/TR/css-color-4/#css-system-colors&lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2FTR%2Fcss-color-4%2F%23css-system-colors&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cakyereboah%40microsoft.com%7C4e8179bfc54e4c5f71ce08df29770355%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639275263355947969%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=bn%2BZS%2FTPPurMIPKv%2FVMTsLP2bdHKrG9T6%2BcY5ReRXpY%3D&amp;reserved=0"&gt;https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2FTR%2Fcss-color-4%2F%23css-system-colors&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cakyereboah%40microsoft.com%7C4e8179bfc54e4c5f71ce08df29770355%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639275263355947969%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=bn%2BZS%2FTPPurMIPKv%2FVMTsLP2bdHKrG9T6%2BcY5ReRXpY%3D&amp;reserved=0&lt;/a&gt;&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

*Summary*
`AccentColor` and `AccentColorText` reflect the element's effective 
`accent-color` value instead of only platform-provided system accent 
colors. This allows CSS to reference the same colors used by `accent-color` 
styling, making it easier to keep custom styling consistent with form 
controls and other accented UI. It aligns Chromium's behavior with the CSS 
Color Module Level 4 specification.

*Blink component*
Blink&gt;CSS 
&lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fissues.chromium.org%2Fissues%3Fq%3Dcustomfield1222907%3A%2522Blink%253ECSS%2522&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cakyereboah%40microsoft.com%7C4e8179bfc54e4c5f71ce08df29770355%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639275263355961615%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=%2FrOBhNA%2FtkSP%2F4hyYzb8PGvHOogw2%2B8dPMdUb8ZjmPM%3D&amp;reserved=0"&gt;https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fissues.chromium.org%2Fissues%3Fq%3Dcustomfield1222907%3A%2522Blink%253ECSS%2522&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cakyereboah%40microsoft.com%7C4e8179bfc54e4c5f71ce08df29770355%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639275263355961615%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=%2FrOBhNA%2FtkSP%2F4hyYzb8PGvHOogw2%2B8dPMdUb8ZjmPM%3D&amp;reserved=0&lt;/a&gt;&gt;

*Web Feature ID*
accentcolor 
&lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwebstatus.dev%2Ffeatures%2Faccentcolor&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cakyereboah%40microsoft.com%7C4e8179bfc54e4c5f71ce08df29770355%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639275263355977495%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=p%2FkBdXHRL5kxO89K2nARX2JxANP06XnWkaZWeJ56tjQ%3D&amp;reserved=0"&gt;https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwebstatus.dev%2Ffeatures%2Faccentcolor&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cakyereboah%40microsoft.com%7C4e8179bfc54e4c5f71ce08df29770355%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639275263355977495%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=p%2FkBdXHRL5kxO89K2nARX2JxANP06XnWkaZWeJ56tjQ%3D&amp;reserved=0&lt;/a&gt;&gt;

*Motivation*
Currently, `AccentColor` and `AccentColorText` keywords have been 
implemented in a limited capacity for Chromium. They reflect the OS' chosen 
system accent color when `accent-color` is set to `auto` in an installed 
web app, and return a default value otherwise. The CSSWG resolved that the 
keywords should reflect the value of `accent-color`, allowing developers to 
use the keywords for intuitive styling of elements. Without this change, 
the keywords provide no additional value unless being used specifically for 
a system accent color.

*Initial public proposal*
[css-color-4] [css-ui-4] `color: AccentColor; accent-color: currentColor` 
cycle · Issue #14192 · w3c/csswg-drafts 
&lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fw3c%2Fcsswg-drafts%2Fissues%2F14192%23issuecomment-5202877510&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cakyereboah%40microsoft.com%7C4e8179bfc54e4c5f71ce08df29770355%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639275263355994546%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=tIgdVWj6wmIADgr1%2BOW0VrMmLjlBNAV8MU4cdc8ZYMo%3D&amp;reserved=0"&gt;https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fw3c%2Fcsswg-drafts%2Fissues%2F14192%23issuecomment-5202877510&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cakyereboah%40microsoft.com%7C4e8179bfc54e4c5f71ce08df29770355%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639275263355994546%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=tIgdVWj6wmIADgr1%2BOW0VrMmLjlBNAV8MU4cdc8ZYMo%3D&amp;reserved=0&lt;/a&gt;&gt;

*TAG review*
This resolution is a minor update to an existing API, it is a final 
published standard and is actively being worked on by another browser.

*TAG review status*
Not applicable

*Risks*
*Interoperability and Compatibility*
Low risk. This change aligns Chromium with the CSS Color Module Level 4 
specification for `AccentColor` and `AccentColorText`. Sites using these 
keywords may observe different color values when `accent-color` is 
specified, but the new behavior matches the standardized definition of the 
keywords and improves interoperability.

*Gecko*: Positive (
&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1438"&gt;https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1438&lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fmozilla%2Fstandards-positions%2Fissues%2F1438&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cakyereboah%40microsoft.com%7C4e8179bfc54e4c5f71ce08df29770355%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639275263356007096%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=0ZKaYE%2BlLXwtkD2mmQbR3VF5BIOBMgr%2FTDUPZwVy2yg%3D&amp;reserved=0"&gt;https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fmozilla%2Fstandards-positions%2Fissues%2F1438&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cakyereboah%40microsoft.com%7C4e8179bfc54e4c5f71ce08df29770355%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639275263356007096%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=0ZKaYE%2BlLXwtkD2mmQbR3VF5BIOBMgr%2FTDUPZwVy2yg%3D&amp;reserved=0&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
)

*WebKit*: Shipped/Shipping (&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/74949"&gt;https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/74949&lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FWebKit%2FWebKit%2Fpull%2F74949&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cakyereboah%40microsoft.com%7C4e8179bfc54e4c5f71ce08df29770355%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639275263356018987%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=Yc1GISp%2FjDoVdVPhHZiP3VAF1oWvkQt9viUhRi6WxTg%3D&amp;reserved=0"&gt;https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FWebKit%2FWebKit%2Fpull%2F74949&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cakyereboah%40microsoft.com%7C4e8179bfc54e4c5f71ce08df29770355%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C639275263356018987%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=Yc1GISp%2FjDoVdVPhHZiP3VAF1oWvkQt9viUhRi6WxTg%3D&amp;reserved=0&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
)
