&gt; On Wed, Oct 21, 2026 at 8:15 AM Mike Taylor &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="89e4e0e2ecfde8a7a7a7c9eae1fbe6e4e0fce4a7e6fbee"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt; 
