*Availability expectation* Feature is available on Web Platform Baseline within 12 months of launch in Chrome. Safari is mid-implementation and Mozilla has shown positive signals towards implementation.
*Adoption expectation* Feature is considered best practice for providing `accent-color` styling as a value keyword within 12 months of reaching Web Platform baseline.
*Adoption plan* We will drive availability through the existing CSSWG standardization and coordination with other browser vendors. For adoption, we will update MDN and Chrome developer documentation to recommend AccentColor and AccentColorText as the preferred way to reuse the effective accent-color value in authored CSS.
*Non-OSS dependencies* /Does the feature depend on any code or APIs outside the Chromium open source repository and its open-source dependencies to function?/ No.
