&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; On Wed, Oct 28, 2026 at 3:56 PM Daniel Bratell &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="90f2e2f1e4f5fcbebebed0f7fdf1f9fcbef3fffd"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; wrote:
&gt;&gt;
