&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; *&gt; Yes&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://wpt.fyi/results/fetch/api/abort/general.any.html"&gt;https://wpt.fyi/results/fetch/api/abort/general.any.html&lt;/a&gt; 
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://wpt.fyi/results/fetch/api/abort/general.any.html"&gt;https://wpt.fyi/results/fetch/api/abort/general.any.html&lt;/a&gt;&gt; Specifically 
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; the 
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; tests: * response.arrayBuffer() rejects with abort reason if already 
