&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/w3ctag/design-reviews/issues/1218#issuecomment-5342165759"&gt;https://github.com/w3ctag/design-reviews/issues/1218#issuecomment-5342165759&lt;/a&gt;
