&gt;&gt; &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="95f7f9fcfbfeb8f1f0e3d5f6fde7faf8fce0f8bbfae7f2"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt; wrote:
