WebKit: No signal (&lt;a rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/716"&gt;https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/716&lt;/a&gt;)
Web developers: No signals
Other signals:
WebView application risks
