Debuggability No information provided
Will this feature be supported on all six Blink platforms (Windows, Mac, Linux, ChromeOS, Android, and Android WebView)? Yes
Is this feature fully tested by web-platform-tests? Yes &lt;a rel="nofollow" href="https://wpt.fyi/results/?label=master&amp;label=experimental&amp;aligned&amp;q=scroll-snap-type-pair"&gt;https://wpt.fyi/results/?label=master&amp;label=experimental&amp;aligned&amp;q=scroll-snap-type-pair&lt;/a&gt;
Flag name on about://flags No information provided
Finch feature name CSSScrollSnapTypePair
Rollout plan Will ship enabled for all users
Requires code in //chrome? False
Tracking bug &lt;a rel="nofollow" href="https://crbug.com/542706103"&gt;https://crbug.com/542706103&lt;/a&gt;
