On Wed, Sep 23, 2026 at 8:06 AM Rick Byers &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="3e4c5c471010107e5d564c5153574b5310514c59"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt; wrote:

