&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; *Summary*
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; The `anchors-valid` value was implemented as part of
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://crbug.com/329703412"&gt;https://crbug.com/329703412&lt;/a&gt; but subsequently reverted, due to spec
