&gt;
&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5657801797009408"&gt;https://chromestatus.com/feature/5657801797009408&lt;/a&gt;
&gt;
&gt; Feedback submission: 
&gt; *&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/WICG/connection-allowlists/issues*"&gt;https://github.com/WICG/connection-allowlists/issues*&lt;/a&gt; 
&gt; &lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/WICG/connection-allowlists/issues"&gt;https://github.com/WICG/connection-allowlists/issues&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
&gt;
