&lt;pre&gt;Set the stage; requested all of the prepare to ship approvals. I'll post
here when I have all of the approvals.&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

Forgot this was added to the LNA spec, I will note that it was in the LNA
spec for less than 3 weeks (added Jun 15, 2026 here
&lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/WICG/local-network-access/commit/345eafde94fe9a3f81d29f6bed6d055643cd4717"&gt;https://github.com/WICG/local-network-access/commit/345eafde94fe9a3f81d29f6bed6d055643cd4717&lt;/a&gt;&gt;,
then removed Jul 6, 2026 here
&lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/WICG/local-network-access/commit/92657b3869920d973aea00c93e861c4b8751bda9"&gt;https://github.com/WICG/local-network-access/commit/92657b3869920d973aea00c93e861c4b8751bda9&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
).

It was in the PNA spec (here
&lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://wicg.github.io/private-network-access/#csp"&gt;https://wicg.github.io/private-network-access/#csp&lt;/a&gt;&gt;); the LNA spec copied
the PNA text for the three-week period when we thought we would keep it,
before deciding to remove it entirely.

/hubert


