&gt;&gt; removal since it appears that's what you're asking for).
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; I assume this will have a killswitch, just in case some enterprise was
&gt;&gt; somehow relying on it or something, right?
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; LGTM2 conditional on the above.
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; Rick
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; On Wed, Oct 7, 2026 at 5:20 PM Chris Harrelson &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="95f6fde7fce6bbbbbbd5f6fde7faf8fce0f8bbfae7f2"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
