&lt;pre&gt;Actually sorry, it looks like we aren't able to correct the stage for you
in the tool. Please set the stage to &quot;prepare to ship&quot;, the tool will
require you to get (for example) Enterprise approval for shipping a
breaking change.&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

Rick

On Wed, Oct 7, 2026 at 5:27 PM Rick Byers &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="b1c3d3c89f9f9ff1d2d9c3dedcd8c4dc9fdec3d6"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt; wrote:

&gt; It looks like this was removed from the spec here
