&gt;&gt; directly without a deprecation trial.
&gt;&gt; On Wednesday, September 30, 2026 at 3:22:59 PM UTC-4 Chromestatus wrote:
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt; *Contact emails*
&gt;&gt;&gt; &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="2d454e0303036d4e455f424044584003425f4a"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;
